1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,016
Kubu mie ayam, berhenti demo! Elu menang!

2
00:00:03,176 --> 00:00:05,435
Day tiga! Gw masak mie ayam!

3
00:00:05,595 --> 00:00:08,798
Empat puluh dua like! Buset, niat bener!

4
00:00:08,958 --> 00:00:11,976
Nasgor dua puluh delapan. Sabar ye, bos!

5
00:00:12,136 --> 00:00:14,900
Jangan bakar gerobak! Cicilannya belom lunas!

6
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:17,315
Lah, disuruh pake ayam sisa kemaren?

7
00:00:17,475 --> 00:00:19,970
Ayam kemaren udeh ludes! Gw belanja lagi!

8
00:00:20,130 --> 00:00:23,561
Ayam baru, mie, sawi. Duit gw melayang!

9
00:00:23,721 --> 00:00:26,620
Bang, bawangnya bonus dong. Sesama pengusaha!

10
00:00:26,780 --> 00:00:29,862
Dikasih satu siung. Ya udeh, rezeki!

11
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:33,253
Bawang masuk! Ayam masuk! Kecapnya secukupnya!

12
00:00:33,413 --> 00:00:36,137
Eh, kebanyakan! Ini ayam apa kolam kecap?!

13
00:00:36,297 --> 00:00:39,089
Buset, wanginya! Kucing aje ikut ngantre!

14
00:00:39,249 --> 00:00:41,549
Elu bawa duit? Jangan bayar pake meong!

15
00:00:41,709 --> 00:00:45,210
Sekarang mienya. Rebus, angkat... eh, nyangkut!

16
00:00:45,370 --> 00:00:48,177
Ditarik dikit... lah, kagak abis-abis!

17
00:00:48,557 --> 00:00:51,436
Ini mie panjang amat! Apa kabel charger?!

18
00:00:52,036 --> 00:00:54,412
Jangan ketawa! Elu bantuin pegang mangkok!

19
00:00:54,812 --> 00:00:57,876
Nah! Ayam, sawi. Jadi juga mie ayam!

20
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:01,132
Mangga, pesenan elu. Mie ayam pertama gw!

21
00:01:01,292 --> 00:01:03,985
Lah, baru disuap, mangkoknya dibalikin?!

22
00:01:04,145 --> 00:01:06,911
Kurang enak, ye? Jujur aje, gw kuat.

23
00:01:07,411 --> 00:01:10,679
Oh, nambah?! Bilang dong! Jantung gw copot!

24
00:01:11,029 --> 00:01:13,709
Nih, ayamnya gw tambahin. Jangan bilang-bilang!

25
00:01:13,869 --> 00:01:16,865
Lah, belakang elu denger! Semua minta tambah!

26
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:20,460
Menu kedua resmi! Ayam geprek tetep ada!

27
00:01:20,620 --> 00:01:24,265
Kemaren lima pelanggan. Sekarang delapan! Hatur nuhun!

28
00:01:24,425 --> 00:01:28,095
Dua menu, satu gerobak. Makin sempit, buset!

29
00:01:28,255 --> 00:01:30,517
Besok menu ketiga! Elu mau pesen ape?

30
00:01:30,677 --> 00:01:33,239
Komen! Nyang paling banyak like, gw masak!
